    <bp:title rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Mitochondrial aconitase reaction with nitric oxide, S-nitrosoglutathione, and peroxynitrite: mechanisms and relative contributions to aconitase inactivation</bp:title>
    <bp:author rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Tórtora, Verónica</bp:author>
